    "title": "Trump Says Iran Has Requested A Ceasefire - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ethan Buchanan ,\n14 hours ago Photo: Andrew Harnik President Trump announced today via Truth Social that the leaders of the Iranian regime have requested a ceasefire.\nAccording to the post from President Trump, a ceasefire will not be considered until the Strait of Hormuz is reopened.\nSo far, Iran has been unwilling to negotiate with the United States, and it's unclear if that has changed, but this could mark a turning point in the war.",
